# Trim docker build context — exclude large/irrelevant trees.

# vendored libs we don't need for Linux build (Linux uses system mupdf)
sioyek/mupdf/
sioyek/zlib/
sioyek/android/
sioyek/windows_runtime/

# macOS-only build outputs
sioyek/limn.app/
sioyek/sioyek.app/
sioyek/*.app/

# build artifacts that should be regenerated inside container
sioyek/*.o
sioyek/pdf_viewer/*.o
sioyek/moc_*.cpp
sioyek/moc_predefs.h
sioyek/qrc_resources.cpp
sioyek/Makefile

# logs / scratch
limn-repl.log
/tmp/

# v0.37 A1c: .git/ IS needed in docker build context so qmake can
# run `git rev-parse HEAD` and bake the commit hash into the binary
# via DEFINES (see pdf_viewer_build_config.pro).  Without it, the
# binary's --version reports "unknown" and provenance is broken.
# Cost: ~29 MB build context — acceptable for the dogfood guarantee.
.gitignore

# direnv / build outputs (not needed inside container)
.envrc
result*
# flake.nix + flake.lock ARE needed (Dockerfile uses nix develop)

# editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
